---
title: "US 2.0.1, 2.0.6: View Sites and Past Visits on an Interactive Map / Search and Filter Sites by County on the Map"
config:
  theme: base
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 60
    boxMargin: 12
    diagramMarginX: 45
    diagramMarginY: 30
    messageMargin: 38
    noteMargin: 16
    mirrorActors: true
    width: 190
    height: 90
  themeVariables:
    background: "#ffffff"
    primaryColor: "#69a8ef"
    primaryBorderColor: "#333333"
    primaryTextColor: "#111111"
    actorBkg: "#69a8ef"
    actorBorder: "#333333"
    actorTextColor: "#111111"
    actorLineColor: "#555555"
    signalColor: "#333333"
    signalTextColor: "#111111"
    activationBkgColor: "#cdd3db"
    activationBorderColor: "#cdd3db"
    noteBkgColor: "#ffe344"
    noteBorderColor: "#d4ba24"
    noteTextColor: "#111111"
    labelBoxBkgColor: "#ffffff"
    labelBoxBorderColor: "#555555"
    labelTextColor: "#111111"
    loopTextColor: "#111111"
    altBackground: "#ffffff"
  themeCSS: |
    .actor-line {
      stroke-dasharray: 10 10 !important;
      stroke-width: 1.25px !important;
    }
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Steward
    participant Map as Steward map page<br/>Leaflet (Proposed)
    participant Tiles as OpenStreetMap<br/>tile server
    participant Server as Server actions<br/>(Proposed)
    participant DB as Supabase<br/>PostgreSQL
    participant S3 as AWS S3

    Note over Steward,S3: Covers US 2.0.1 and 2.0.6. Today the only map is the admin heat map in<br/>/admin/dashboard (components/Map.tsx). It geocodes Site names through /api/geocode<br/>(OpenCage). This flow replaces geocoding with stored geometry (US 6.0.1).

    alt Open from the menu
        Steward->>Map: Select Map in HeaderDropdown (Proposed)
    else Open from a Site page (2.0.1 AT3)
        Steward->>Map: Select "View on map" on /detail/[namesite] (Proposed)
    end
    activate Map
    Map->>Tiles: Get base tiles
    Tiles-->>Map: Tiles

    Map->>Server: getSiteMapData()
    activate Server
    Server->>Server: Check session and approved account (Proposed)
    alt No valid session or account not approved
        Server-->>Map: Refuse (401)
        Map-->>Steward: Go to /login
    else Access allowed
        Server->>DB: Read active W26_sites-pa rows, W26_ab_counties<br/>and Site geometry (US 6.0.1)
        activate DB
        DB-->>Server: Sites with boundary, centre point and county
        deactivate DB
        Server-->>Map: Site list
        Map-->>Steward: Draw the boundary of each active Site (AT1)
        Note right of Map: A Site with no geometry is not drawn.<br/>US 6.0.1 lists it for an Admin to fix.
    end
    deactivate Server

    opt Map opened from a Site page
        Map-->>Steward: Highlight that Site and zoom to it
    end

    opt Zoom to a Site that has GPX tracks (2.0.1 AT2)
        Map->>Server: getSiteTracks(siteId)
        activate Server
        Server->>Server: Same session check as above
        Server->>DB: Read W26_gpx_tracks rows of the Site (US 2.0.9)
        activate DB
        DB-->>Server: Track storage keys
        deactivate DB
        Server-->>Map: Short-lived presigned GET URLs
        deactivate Server
        Map->>S3: Get each GPX file
        S3-->>Map: GPX files
        Map-->>Steward: Draw tracks as lines in a style<br/>different from the boundary
    end

    opt Filter by county (2.0.6 AT1, AT2)
        Steward->>Map: Select one or more counties
        Map->>Map: Keep only Sites in those counties, in the browser (proposed).<br/>The /sites page has no county filter today.
        Map-->>Steward: Show only matching Sites
        Steward->>Map: Clear the filter
        Map-->>Steward: Show all active Sites again
    end

    opt Search by name (2.0.6 AT3)
        Steward->>Map: Type a Site name
        Map-->>Steward: Show matching names. Same text match as<br/>the free-text search on the /sites page (exists there)
        alt No match
            Map-->>Steward: Show "No Sites found"
        else Steward selects a match
            Map-->>Steward: Centre the map on that Site
        end
    end
    deactivate Map

    Note over Steward,S3: Filter and search use the Site list that is already loaded. They make no server call.<br/>Open questions: GPX storage (see US 2.0.9) and the time window of tracks to show.
